    feat(semantic): read a generic component at its default instantiation

    ADR 0026 S5. A generic component's props parameter has its type
    parameters open, so Poly<E extends ElementType = "div"> had two props
    where <Poly /> has every attribute of a div. The checker API cannot
    instantiate a signature, so the instantiation is written as source: one
